  "html": "<article id=\"post-6731\" class=\"container post-6731 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow center-content-mobile full-width-mobile has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-red-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-info\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\">HVAC, Plumbing &amp; Indoor Air Quality Services in Durham, NC&nbsp;</h1>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services handles heating and cooling, plumbing, and indoor air quality across Durham, from the tobacco-era bungalows of Trinity Park and Watts-Hillandale to the new construction near RTP and Southpoint, with every job quoted before it starts and calls answered 24/7. Durham&#8217;s older neighborhoods carry equipment and&nbsp;pipe&nbsp;from another era, and that shapes the work more than anything else in this market.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The city&#8217;s tobacco and textile decades left Durham with a deep supply of pre-war and mid-century homes. In practice that means furnaces on their third replacement, ductwork routed through unconditioned crawl spaces, and galvanized supply lines corroding quietly inside plaster walls. We know those houses, and we know the tightly built new construction along the I-40 corridor just as well.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-1 full-width-mobile is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"badge mb-3\" style='min-height:unset;'>\n    <div class=\"badge__content\">\n        <svg width=\"45\" height=\"45\" viewBox=\"0 0 45 45\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <title>Google</title>\n            <path d=\"M42.0046 22.9145C42.0046 21.4661 41.8746 20.0733 41.6332 18.7363H22.395V26.647H33.3882C32.9054 29.191 31.457 31.3451 29.2844 32.7935V37.9373H35.9137C39.7762 34.372 42.0046 29.1353 42.0046 22.9145Z\" fill=\"#4285F4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 42.8766C27.9112 42.8766 32.535 41.0568 35.9147 37.9371L29.2854 32.7933C27.4655 34.0189 25.1443 34.7617 22.396 34.7617C17.0851 34.7617 12.5727 31.1777 10.9571 26.3496H4.16064V31.6234C7.52175 38.2899 14.4111 42.8766 22.396 42.8766Z\" fill=\"#34A853\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10.9608 26.3308C10.5523 25.1052 10.3109 23.8053 10.3109 22.4498C10.3109 21.0942 10.5523 19.7943 10.9608 18.5687V13.2949H4.16436C2.77164 16.0432 1.97314 19.1444 1.97314 22.4498C1.97314 25.7551 2.77164 28.8563 4.16436 31.6046L9.45671 27.4821L10.9608 26.3308Z\" fill=\"#FBBC05\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 10.155C25.4043 10.155 28.0783 11.1949 30.2138 13.2004L36.0633 7.35097C32.5165 4.04557 27.9112 2.02148 22.396 2.02148C14.4111 2.02148 7.52175 6.60818 4.16064 13.2933L10.9571 18.567C12.5727 13.7389 17.0851 10.155 22.396 10.155Z\" fill=\"#EA4335\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container\">\n            <p class=\"h6 badge__content__rating-container__title\">Google Rating</p>\n            <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars\">\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__number\">\n                    5                </div>\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container\">\n                    <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"/images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"The entrance of Happy Home Heating and Cooling in Durham, NC\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-secondary-inverse-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wrap-mobile flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 is-horizontal is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-cdbf0242 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-db3ccc14 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Heating and Cooling for Durham Homes&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durham sits squarely in the Piedmont pattern of long humid summers and winters that swing from mild to icy in a week. Natural gas reaches most of the city, so furnaces, heat pumps, and hybrids all show up on our schedule daily.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/cooling/air-conditioning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Conditioning Services in Durham</strong></a>&nbsp;Installation, replacement, repair, and tune-ups across every major brand, with the repair-versus-replace decision laid out in real numbers when an older unit begins to slip.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/heating/gas-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Gas Furnaces and Heat Pumps in Durham</strong></a>&nbsp;Furnaces dominate the established neighborhoods while&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/heating/heat-pumps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">heat pumps</a>&nbsp;carry newer construction. We service both and configure hybrid setups where switching fuels&nbsp;saves&nbsp;money over a variable winter.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/cooling/mini-split\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Ductless Mini-Split Systems</strong></a>&nbsp;Trinity Park and Old West Durham bungalows were framed decades before central air.&nbsp;Mini-splits&nbsp;condition those rooms individually without touching original walls, and they solve converted attics and sunrooms the same way.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indoor Air Quality in a Humid Climate&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durham springs bury the city in&nbsp;pollen&nbsp;and Durham summers keep humidity high into September. Older homes with leaky ducts and vented crawl spaces pull both indoors.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/dehumidifiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Whole-Home and Crawlspace Dehumidifiers</strong></a>: Controlled humidity protects plaster and framing in older homes and cuts the mold risk under any house.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality/air-ducts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Duct Cleaning and Sealing</strong></a>: Decades-old duct runs&nbsp;leak conditioned&nbsp;air and&nbsp;recirculate&nbsp;dust. Cleaning and sealing addresses both&nbsp;in&nbsp;one visit.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality/air-purifiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Filtration and Purification</strong></a>: High-efficiency filtration knocks down the indoor pollen load during the Triangle&#8217;s long allergy season.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plumbing for a City of Old Pipe and New Growth&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durham&#8217;s municipal water comes from Lake Michie and the Little River Reservoir, and it reaches the tap&nbsp;relatively soft, so softeners rarely justify themselves in town. The city&#8217;s real plumbing story is age: galvanized and cast-iron lines still serve thousands of pre-war homes.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/repiping-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Repiping and Pipe Repair</strong></a>&nbsp;Corroded galvanized pipe narrows year by year, cutting pressure and tinting water long before a visible leak appears.&nbsp;Repiping&nbsp;ends the cycle and protects renovated spaces from hidden failures.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-heater-installation-replacements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Water Heater Installation and Replacement</strong></a>&nbsp;Tank and tankless units sized to the household, with fuel matched to the home&#8217;s gas or electric service.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/gas-lines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Gas Line Services</strong></a>&nbsp;With gas so widespread in Durham, we run and repair the lines behind ranges, dryers, furnaces, and outdoor appliances, leak-tested before we leave.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/frozen-burst-pipe-repair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Frozen and Burst Pipe Repair</strong></a>&nbsp;A Triangle freeze finds old, under-insulated lines first. We stop the water fast and repair the break properly.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/kitchen-bathroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Kitchen and Bathroom Plumbing</strong></a>&nbsp;Bungalow renovation or new-build punch list, our licensed&nbsp;plumbers&nbsp;price the work first and finish it cleanly. Homeowners wanting&nbsp;better-tasting&nbsp;water can add&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-treatment-filtration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">filtration</a>&nbsp;at the tap or for the whole house.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Durham Homeowners Call Happy Home&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Old-house problems that make other companies shrug are the problems we staff for, from tricky duct retrofits to pipe hidden in century-old walls. Our trained technicians diagnose first and present the price before work begins, backed by honest, upfront pricing and a 100% money-back guarantee. Call, chat, or book online to schedule service anywhere in Durham.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"accordion\" style=\"--_accordion-separator-color: #076395\">\n            <details class=\"accordion-item\" data-custom-open=\"true\" open>\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Is emergency HVAC and plumbing service available in Durham 24/7? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes. We answer around the clock across Durham and Durham County, including nights, weekends, and holidays.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">My Durham bungalow has no ductwork. Can it still get central air? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes, through ductless mini-splits. Compact wall units connected to an outdoor compressor deliver heating and cooling room by room, with nothing cut through original plaster.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Do Durham homes need water softeners? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>In-town homes usually do not. Durham&#8217;s water from Lake Michie and the Little River Reservoir arrives treated and relatively soft. Filtration for taste, or well treatment for rural north Durham properties, is the more common request.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">What is behind the low water pressure in my older Durham home? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Galvanized pipe corroding from the inside is the most frequent cause. The corrosion narrows the line gradually, and repiping restores full flow and clears the discoloration that comes with it.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Where else in the Triangle do you provide service? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Chapel Hill, Bahama, and Raleigh are all inside our coverage area. The Service Areas menu lists every community we serve.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>    </div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow py-5\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Powered by NearU — We’re here to make your HVAC Service experience the best one yet!</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"430\" height=\"98\" src=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png\" alt=\"NearU\" class=\"wp-image-36\" style=\"width:220px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png 430w, /images/2024/02/NearU-300x68.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 100vw, 430px\" /></figure>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">NearU is setting up a new standard of HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our companies with better resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. If you’ve recently learned that your go-to HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator company has joined NearU, then this is something to get excited about! We protect the people and culture that make each company great, while ensuring their customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-6731 -->"
}